  {
   "name": "tasks.list.time_is_the_tasks_clock",
   "spec": "tasks.list",
   "about": "NOT_YET_IN_PYTHON: A task that is doing carries time, the object task.get gives: its length in seconds, whether that is the default, start, end, overdue_since null while in time, and how many overrun notices were sent. Needs --var tasks_timed_owner: an agent with a doing task in time.",
